# Environment Variables

# =====================================================
# REQUIRED FOR CONTACT FORM TO ACTUALLY SEND EMAILS
# =====================================================
# If this variable is not set, the form falls back to
# a mock mode (logs to console) — safe for Vercel preview.

# Set this to your deployed backend API base URL:
# Example: https://varunrohith-api.onrender.com
VITE_API_URL=

# =====================================================
# VERCEL DEPLOYMENT STEPS
# =====================================================
# 1. Push this repo to GitHub
# 2. Go to https://vercel.com → Import project
# 3. Select your GitHub repository
# 4. Set Framework Preset: Vite
# 5. Add VITE_API_URL under Environment Variables (if you have a backend)
# 6. Deploy → Done! Your site will be live at *.vercel.app
